---

### Step 2: Ab Vercel Par Login Karen

1. Apne browser me ek naya tab kholein aur **[vercel.com](https://vercel.com)** par jaayein.
2. Wahan **Sign Up** ya **Log In** par click karen aur **`Continue with GitHub`** ka option select karen.
3. Login hone ke baad aapko Vercel ka dashboard dikhega jahan aap apni repository import kar sakte hain.

---

**Mujhe aage batane ke liye:**
* Jab aap `vercel.json` file bana len aur Vercel par login kar len, to mujhe **Vercel dashboard ka screenshot** bhejein. Main aapko aakhri click karwa kar site live karwa dunga!
